# Reown (WalletConnect) project id — create one free at https://dashboard.reown.com
# This is NOT a secret; it identifies the app to the WalletConnect relay and ships in
# the bundle. It is the only configuration this app needs.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the value, then restart `npx expo start`.
EXPO_PUBLIC_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=
